========

AI Agent vs Tool

| Component       | Responsibility                                      |
| --------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |
| AI Agent        | Decides **whether** to search.                      |
| Web Search Tool | Retrieves information from the internet.            |
| LLM             | Understands the results and generates the response. |


