In Your Projects

For your TravelGenie-AI, you could have:

| Agent            | Tool Used                     |
| ---------------- | ----------------------------- |
| Flight Agent     | Flight Search API             |
| Hotel Agent      | Hotel Booking API             |
| Weather Agent    | Weather API                   |
| Tourist Agent    | Web Search                    |
| Restaurant Agent | Google Maps or Restaurant API |


Each agent chooses the appropriate tool based on the user's request.

Key point

An agent doesn't automatically have internet access. It must be given access to a web search tool or API, 
and then it can decide when to use that tool as part of its workflow.

