Which one should you learn?

Since you're learning Agentic AI, AutoGen, and building multi-agent projects, I'd recommend:

🥇 Tavily API – Designed specifically for AI agents and RAG.
🥈 Brave Search API – Good free tier and web search.
🥉 Serper API – Popular and easy to integrate.

These APIs are much more commonly used in modern AI agent frameworks than Google's older Custom Search API.

